  "heading": "\\real.function.limit:at{x0}:of{f}",
  "heading_latex": "\\textrm{limit of }f\\textrm{ at }x_0\\quad\\htmlClass{mlg-title-written}{\\lim_{x \\to x_0} f(x)}",
  "body_text": null,
  "page": null,
  "source": "[\\real.function.limit:at{x0}:of{f}]\nDefines: L is \\real\nusing: U \\:subset:/ \\reals\nwhen:\n. x0 is \\real\n. f is \\function:on{U}:to{\\reals}\nexpresses:\n. forAll: epsilon is \\real\n  where: epsilon \\:real.greater?:/ \\real.zero\n  then:\n  . exists: delta is \\real\n    suchThat:\n    . delta \\:real.greater?:/ \\real.zero\n    . forAll: x is \\real\n      where:\n      . x \"in\" U\n      . x != x0\n      . \\real.abs(x \\.real.-./ x0) \\:real.less?:/ delta\n      then: \\real.abs(f(x) \\.real.-./ L) \\:real.less?:/ epsilon\nDocumented:\n. called: \"limit of $f?$ at $x0?$\"\n. written: \"\\lim_{x \\to x0?} f?(x)\"\n. description: \"The limit of $f(x)$ as $x$ approaches $x_0$ equals $L$.\"\nId: \"3af5db3a-ae38-4af7-876b-a775e8f83089\"",
